🤝 YOU MAKE THE INTRODUCTION. THE APP DOES THE MATH.

You don’t need to calculate every cashback transaction yourself.

When an eligible partner deposit is made, METATRONICS automatically identifies the partner’s level and calculates your cashback:

🟡 Level 1 — 10%
🟡 Level 2 — 5%
🟡 Level 3 — 3%

For example, when a direct partner deposits $1,000, the system calculates $100 in cashback.

The transaction appears immediately under Career → Cashback with the status Frozen. At this stage, it is pending cashback and is not yet available for withdrawal.

📲 Each transaction card displays:

• the partner’s level;
• the deposit amount;
• your cashback amount;
• the current status;
• the date the cashback becomes available.

⏳ How the 30-day hold works:

• the cashback remains frozen for 30 days;
• a partial withdrawal by the partner reduces it proportionally;
• a full withdrawal forfeits the cashback;
• on Day 31, the remaining amount is credited to your income wallet.

Your next step is simple: copy your referral link and show METATRONICS to someone who wants to learn more.

You start the conversation. The system handles the calculations.

🔗 Open METATRONICS⁠

Cashback depends on eligible partner deposits and their subsequent actions. Financial transactions involve risk.
